<Definition title="Quest Counter" section="States">
  <QuestCounter slot="preview" client:only="react" />

  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>Accept, report, and cancel quests. Difficulty tabs filter the available quest list.</p>

  <h2>Behavior</h2>
  <p>Quests are organized by difficulty tier. Locked quests require completion of a parent quest before they become available. Reporting a completed quest grants rewards.</p>

  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>Guild Counter area, accessed by interacting with the Quest Counter NPC.</p>
</Definition>
